4:["$","div",null,{"className":"prose prose-slate prose-lg max-w-none prose-headings:font-bold prose-headings:tracking-tight prose-h2:text-2xl prose-h2:mt-12 prose-h2:mb-4 prose-h3:text-xl prose-h3:mt-8 prose-h3:mb-3 prose-p:leading-relaxed prose-p:text-slate-600 prose-li:text-slate-600 prose-a:text-indigo-600 prose-a:no-underline hover:prose-a:underline prose-strong:text-slate-900","children":[["$","p",null,{"children":"Whether you're planning a baby shower, classroom activity, wedding reception, or party game night, custom bingo cards are one of the easiest and most engaging activities you can add to any event. The best part? You can create stunning, personalized bingo cards in less than 5 minutes — completely free."}],["$","p",null,{"children":"In this guide, we'll walk you through everything you need to know about making custom bingo cards online, from choosing your theme to printing perfect cards for your guests."}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"Why Custom Bingo Cards?"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Standard bingo with numbered balls is fun, but custom bingo takes the game to another level. Instead of \"B-12\" or \"N-34,\" your squares contain words, phrases, or images that are meaningful to your specific event. Think \"bouquet toss\" for a wedding, \"photosynthesis\" for a science class, or \"baby yawns\" for a baby shower."}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Custom bingo cards create shared experiences, spark conversations, and give guests something interactive to do. They're the perfect icebreaker that works for every age group."}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"Step 1: Choose Your Theme"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Start by deciding what your bingo card is for. The theme determines everything from your word list to the card's color scheme. Here are the most popular themes:"}],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Wedding Bingo"}]," — Reception moments like first dance, cake cutting, speeches"]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Baby Shower Bingo"}]," — Gifts, baby items, and predictions"]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Classroom Bingo"}]," — Vocabulary words, math facts, science terms"]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Party Bingo"}]," — Fun moments, icebreaker activities, party games"]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Holiday Bingo"}]," — Seasonal words, traditions, and holiday moments"]}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"Step 2: Create Your Word List"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"For a standard 5x5 bingo card, you'll need at least 25 unique items (24 custom squares plus one free space in the center). For the best experience, we recommend creating 30-40 items so each card can be uniquely shuffled."}],["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Pro tip:"}]," Mix easy-to-spot items (things that will definitely happen) with rare ones (things that might happen). This balance keeps the game exciting without making it impossible to win."]}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"Step 3: Design Your Card"}],["$","p",null,{"children":["With ",["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/create","children":"MyBingoCard's free card creator"}],", you can customize every aspect of your card:"]}],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Colors"}]," — Match your event's color palette"]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Fonts"}]," — Choose from elegant to playful typography"]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Card size"}]," — Standard 5x5, compact 3x3, or large 7x7"]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Free space"}]," — Customize the center square text or image"]}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"Step 4: Generate Unique Cards"}],"$L9","$La","$Lb","$Lc","$Ld","$Le","$Lf","$L10","$L11"]}]
