f:["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Prepare prizes"}]," — Even small prizes make the game 10x more exciting. Gift cards, candy, or a centerpiece from the table work great."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Explain the rules"}]," — Not everyone knows bingo. Take 30 seconds to explain: mark squares when the event happens, first to complete a row/column/diagonal wins."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Use a caller or let it happen naturally"}]," — For event bingo (wedding, baby shower), let guests mark squares as moments happen organically. For word/fact bingo, use a caller."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Play multiple rounds"}]," — One round of bingo takes about 15-20 minutes. Plan for 2-3 rounds with different winning patterns (line, corners, full card)."]}]]}]
